  "changes": [
    "Preserve every original16 raw scaling profile; add three general suffix and two exact same-window fallback controls. Select a closed15-profile resource proposal.",
    "Keep named-window query generation and strict ordered typed row oracles; all original16 query/schema/fixture/oracle values are unchanged.",
    "Observe actual return-root DAG local stream edges, bounds object identity, queue ownership, exact two RANGE mappings and output-member ownership; identify three prefix endpoint outputs and distinct ROWS entering/transfer folds.",
    "Unknown or changed final peephole shapes fail closed; global callable totals cannot replace a local witness.",
    "Append15 public allocator fields before consumption, after final-cycle consumption and after stream release/invalidation. Keep all42 specifications, old numeric fields and every existing native check.",
    "Closed StageA validator requires exact30 path or180 raw records, identities, workloads, source/profile hashes, fresh guarded slices, receipts, strict types, request/result boundaries and complete raw protocol bindings.",
    "Raw comparisons expose all five measured child CPU/RSS samples for each phase/profile and strict observed separation, with no accepting ratio, speedup threshold, setup subtraction or allocation-from-RSS claim.",
    "Refresh exactly two of28 spill dependency hashes; no spill policy or execution/quality gate is modified.",
    "Pilot records now require the same existing native run/sample/workload/source identity and complete child/outer-guard protocol as measured records, plus distinct one-cell scopes/reports; pilot success never sets raw measurement or optimization acceptance."
  ],
